            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An overview of the incidence and types of pelvic pain is presented, followed by some practical information concerning the presentation of patients with pelvic pain. Simple physical therapy techniques that are use in treating patients with pelvic pain are also discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
